committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790615964 +0900

Append-only (B=0) makes no writer call on an empty delta

Stage-1 dev: 196 of 1,484 B=0 appends came from empty deltas, where the
writer asserted a value with no records (and the D=1 fallback recomputed
structured facts). That is an implementation artefact, not append-only
semantics. Writes with records are unchanged and remain cached.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
